 "remarks": "Discover your new home in the heart of Norwalk! Beautifully maintained updated 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom condo offering comfort, style, and convenience. This inviting first-floor unit features spacious living areas filled with natural light from oversized windows, mostly hardwood flooring, central air conditioning, updated kitchen with modern cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, and warm butcher-block countertops. Enjoy the added convenience of direct interior access to a private basement, ideal for additional storage. One assigned off-street parking space is located near the unit entrance. . Located near downtown Norwalk, restaurants, shopping, and major commuter routes. An excellent opportunity to enjoy low-maintenance condo living in a convenient location. Schedule your showing today!",
